   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pill**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Gamma Knife, Robot Stop, The River, Evil Death Roll [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **20240413_20240413_1941** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 12 songs; 59 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio processed with Magix EQ and track splitting, then converted to 16-bit FLACs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **20240413_20240413_1941**: taped by Rumbleseat; transferred by Rumbleseat; source: FOB > Taped from in front of the soundboard, about 10 feet high [1]. Also: Rumbleseat taped from ten feet high using Church Audio cardioids and an iRiver H340 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2015-06-12 Great Stage Park, Manchester, TN, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-june-12-2015-great-stage-park-manchester-tn-usa.html) [6]",
